# The lit end brightening over a draw: overlays the spliff and the pipe show over their own art at a
# quarter, a half and three quarters of the draw (the bow's pulling_0..2 grammar, and the bong's
# draw stages). PLACEHOLDERS until Warlon Mhite draws the real ones -- the art is his call.
#
# Re-render with:
#   python3 mctex.py render \
#     textures-src/ember.mctex -o common/src/main/resources/assets/hempdustry/textures \
#     --preview --preview-dir /tmp/tex-preview
#
# The spliff's overlay sits exactly on the ten lit-tip pixels of item/spliff_load (spliff.mctex);
# the pipe's on the five bowl pixels of item/packed_pipe_load. A pixel outside them would draw
# over the paper or the wood.

@palette ember
. = none
# a stage: e the deep coals, E the glow, h the hot core
a = F0484E
A = F08A3C
b = FF6A4C
B = FFA244
c = FFC86A
d = FF8A50
D = FFC060
w = FFF0B0
q = C04A28
r = E8642E

@texture item/spliff_ember_1 16x16 type=item palette=ember
